{
  "template_key": "erp-maker-checker",
  "name": "ERP: draft → CEO gate → check → post",
  "description": "Maker drafts; optional CEO approval when needs_ceo (e.g. 5% discount); Checker owns submit. No free-form CEO Kanban HITL. Chat: run erp maker checker",
  "chat_trigger_phrase": "run erp maker checker",
  "trigger_modes": [
    "manual",
    "chat"
  ],
  "workflow_id_pattern": "erp-mc-{ownerSlug}",
  "kind": "erp",
  "agent_roles": {
    "maker": [
      "ERP Maker A",
      "ERP Maker B"
    ],
    "checker": [
      "ERP Checker"
    ]
  },
  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "trigger-1",
        "type": "trigger",
        "position": {
          "x": 40,
          "y": 220
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "Start",
          "triggerModes": [
            "manual",
            "chat"
          ],
          "chatPhrase": "run erp maker checker",
          "scheduleCron": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "maker-1",
        "type": "agent",
        "position": {
          "x": 260,
          "y": 220
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "ERP Maker A (draft)",
          "agentNameRef": "ERP Maker A",
          "prompt": "You are ERP Maker on Flolah. Goal from CEO/COO:\n\n{{input}}\n\nRules:\n1) Company-scoped erp_* only. Create/update DRAFT docs only — never erp_submit_doc / erp_cancel_doc.\n2) HITL is workflow-only: NEVER invent a free-form CEO Kanban card and never ask the CEO to comment Approved outside a workflow. If policy needs CEO (e.g. 5% discount), do drafts if safe, then signal needs_ceo — the run will open a real CEO Approval node.\n3) When ready for checker without CEO: optional Kanban for ERP Checker titled [ERP] Submit {doctype} {name}; never submit yourself.\n4) End your reply with ONLY one JSON line (no markdown):\n{\"decision\":\"ready_for_checker\"|\"needs_ceo\",\"gate\":null|\"discount_5pct\"|\"other\",\"reason\":\"...\",\"docs\":\"doctypes/names touched\"}\nUse decision=needs_ceo when price/discount/credit/compliance needs CEO; gate=discount_5pct for 5%+ discount.",
          "inputBindings": [
            {
              "id": "prompt",
              "mode": "dynamic",
              "sourceNodeId": "trigger-1",
              "sourceOutputKey": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "if-ceo",
        "type": "if",
        "position": {
          "x": 500,
          "y": 220
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "Needs CEO approval?",
          "taskConfig": {
            "sourceNodeId": "maker-1",
            "sourceOutputKey": "reply",
            "operator": "contains",
            "compareValue": "\"decision\":\"needs_ceo\""
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ceo-approval-1",
        "type": "ceo_approval",
        "position": {
          "x": 740,
          "y": 80
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "CEO Approval (policy gate)",
          "taskConfig": {
            "title": "ERP · CEO policy approval",
            "instructions": "Approve or reject this commercial/policy gate (e.g. 5% discount). Use the Kanban Approve/Reject controls — free-form chat \"Approved\" alone does not resume the workflow."
          },
          "inputBindings": [
            {
              "id": "summary",
              "mode": "dynamic",
              "sourceNodeId": "maker-1",
              "sourceOutputKey": "reply"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "checker-1",
        "type": "agent",
        "position": {
          "x": 980,
          "y": 220
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "ERP Checker (review)",
          "agentNameRef": "ERP Checker",
          "prompt": "You are ERP Checker. CEO/COO goal / Maker output:\n\n{{input}}\n\nMaker summary:\n{{maker-1.reply}}\n\nCEO approval (if any):\n{{ceo-approval-1.reply}}\n\nRules:\n1) Review with list/get. If safe: erp_submit_doc / cancel as required.\n2) If bad: FINDING on Kanban and reassign Maker. No bulk-draft.\n3) End with ONLY one JSON line:\n{\"decision\":\"approved\"|\"rejected\",\"adjustments\":\"...\",\"notes\":\"...\"}",
          "inputBindings": [
            {
              "id": "prompt",
              "mode": "dynamic",
              "sourceNodeId": "maker-1",
              "sourceOutputKey": "reply"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "if-1",
        "type": "if",
        "position": {
          "x": 1220,
          "y": 220
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "If approved (pass 1)",
          "taskConfig": {
            "sourceNodeId": "checker-1",
            "sourceOutputKey": "reply",
            "operator": "contains",
            "compareValue": "\"decision\":\"approved\""
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "maker-2",
        "type": "agent",
        "position": {
          "x": 1460,
          "y": 400
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "ERP Maker A (fix)",
          "agentNameRef": "ERP Maker A",
          "prompt": "Checker rejected your draft. Goal: {{input}}\n\nChecker output:\n{{checker-1.reply}}\n\nFix FINDINGS only; never submit; never invent CEO Kanban.\nEnd with JSON:\n{\"decision\":\"ready_for_checker\"|\"needs_ceo\",\"gate\":null|\"discount_5pct\",\"reason\":\"...\",\"docs\":\"...\"}",
          "inputBindings": [
            {
              "id": "prompt",
              "mode": "dynamic",
              "sourceNodeId": "checker-1",
              "sourceOutputKey": "reply"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "checker-2",
        "type": "agent",
        "position": {
          "x": 1700,
          "y": 400
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "ERP Checker (recheck)",
          "agentNameRef": "ERP Checker",
          "prompt": "Second review after Maker fix.\n\nOriginal goal: {{input}}\nMaker fix: {{maker-2.reply}}\nPrior Checker: {{checker-1.reply}}\n\nSubmit if ok (erp_submit_doc) or reject.\nEnd with ONLY JSON:\n{\"decision\":\"approved\"|\"rejected\",\"adjustments\":\"...\",\"notes\":\"...\"}",
          "inputBindings": [
            {
              "id": "prompt",
              "mode": "dynamic",
              "sourceNodeId": "maker-2",
              "sourceOutputKey": "reply"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "if-2",
        "type": "if",
        "position": {
          "x": 1940,
          "y": 320
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "If approved (pass 2)",
          "taskConfig": {
            "sourceNodeId": "checker-2",
            "sourceOutputKey": "reply",
            "operator": "contains",
            "compareValue": "\"decision\":\"approved\""
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "notify-ok",
        "type": "content_tool",
        "position": {
          "x": 1460,
          "y": 60
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "Notify CEO (approved)",
          "toolName": "notify_ceo",
          "taskConfig": {
            "toolName": "notify_ceo",
            "bodyJson": "{\"message\": \"Maker/Checker completed (approved). See Kanban/Workflows.\", \"title\": \"ERP gate passed\"}"
          },
          "inputBindings": [
            {
              "id": "input",
              "mode": "dynamic",
              "sourceNodeId": "trigger-1",
              "sourceOutputKey": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "notify-escalate",
        "type": "content_tool",
        "position": {
          "x": 2180,
          "y": 400
        },
        "data": {
          "label": "Notify CEO (escalated)",
          "toolName": "notify_ceo",
          "taskConfig": {
            "toolName": "notify_ceo",
            "bodyJson": "{\"message\": \"ERP Maker/Checker still rejected after one fix cycle.\", \"title\": \"ERP gate needs CEO\"}"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
